REQUIREMENTS.md
# Local configuration and credentials must never be committed. The leading slash matters:
# without it the pattern would also exclude the source package named config.
*.env
!/examples/secrets.env
application-local.yaml
/config/
# Private keys, certificates and keystores
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks

